    "id": "8721173580390a9d297e5af06cac3f0b6841f425",
    "message": "testing: ignore Cython's PyPy collection_type warning (#15096)\n\nPyPy 3.11.16 (PyPy 8.0.0) makes Cython-compiled numpy.random emit\n'cython.collection_type only works on PyPy with the C flag\nCYTHON_USE_TYPE_SPECS=1' as a RuntimeWarning on import. hypothesis\nimports numpy.random whenever numpy is loaded, so under\nfilterwarnings=error every @given test fails on the pypy3-xdist job.\nSame numpy 2.4.6 and hypothesis 6.168.1 import cleanly on PyPy 3.11.15.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 via Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>",
    "timestamp": "2026-09-24T07:25:06Z",
    "tree_id": "d9483007eb2fe86f68c29552bb2b239d5c577d98"
  },
